---
# Panel 2 leaves Bob out; panel 3, over it, inherits that, and the relation that names him.
cast:
  ALICE: {reference: alice, at: left_third}
  BOB: {reference: bob, at: right_third}
staging: [ALICE left_of BOB]
---
PANEL 1
ALICE
Hi.

PANEL 2
@cast: {BOB: null}
ALICE
Alone now.

PANEL 3
@over: 2
ALICE
Still alone.
